{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "ckaoglm1410ru8z3", "title": "高并发无忧！Spring Retry 与 Redis Watch 打造坚不可摧的乐观锁方案", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"jETr4\" id=\"jETr4\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc191d9b\" id=\"udc191d9b\">背景及业务场景描述</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u46e977c6\" id=\"u46e977c6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3795dd0e\" id=\"u3795dd0e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">在电商抢购或秒杀活动中，当大量用户同时请求抢购相同商品时，通常会面临以下挑战：</span></p><ol list=\"ue1f1b3c0\"><li fid=\"u13ee7c3f\" data-lake-id=\"u851d8540\" id=\"u851d8540\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u81c99ac2\" id=\"u81c99ac2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">瞬时</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8d8d7e1c\" id=\"u8d8d7e1c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">请求量极大。</span></li><li fid=\"u13ee7c3f\" data-lake-id=\"u02a124b5\" id=\"u02a124b5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2335227b\" id=\"u2335227b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">数据一致性</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1ec34fc0\" id=\"u1ec34fc0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：库存数量必须准确扣减，不能超卖。</span></li><li fid=\"u13ee7c3f\" data-lake-id=\"uf7e5a379\" id=\"uf7e5a379\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue7a732fc\" id=\"ue7a732fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">性能要求高</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub98d3154\" id=\"ub98d3154\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：需要减少数据库的访问和锁竞争。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u43a0a3ee\" id=\"u43a0a3ee\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb557253\" id=\"ufb557253\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">传统方案可能会使用数据库的行级锁或全局锁机制，但对性能要求高的场景可能会遇到瓶颈。Redis作为内存存储，在高并发场景中可以起到流量削峰快速及访问的作用。而Redis提供的</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua60ef6ed\" id=\"ua60ef6ed\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua665768f\" id=\"ua665768f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">WATCH</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6905c59c\" id=\"u6905c59c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">命令可以用于实现乐观锁定，实现实际库存扣减时的并发安全。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"Me2QL\" id=\"Me2QL\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01187c1d\" id=\"u01187c1d\">技术选择及方法</span></h1><ul list=\"u1150815f\"><li fid=\"u778a9e39\" data-lake-id=\"u5f01187f\" id=\"u5f01187f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u977474e8\" id=\"u977474e8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">Redis</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u314b6e7d\" id=\"u314b6e7d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：作为库存统计的存储介质。</span></li><li fid=\"u778a9e39\" data-lake-id=\"u34661fdb\" id=\"u34661fdb\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6622d2fb\" id=\"u6622d2fb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">WATCH + MULTI/EXEC</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ude1e9dd5\" id=\"ude1e9dd5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：通过在扣减库存时对Redis的键进行监控（WATCH），如果在执行事务（MULTI/EXEC）期间该键被其他客户端修改了  ，则事务修改执行失败，客户端可选择重试。</span></li><li fid=\"u778a9e39\" data-lake-id=\"uf23d2ed4\" id=\"uf23d2ed4\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6de88a7c\" id=\"u6de88a7c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">Spring Retry</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaff7dbbb\" id=\"uaff7dbbb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：在出现执行失败时，自动触发重试，重试次数及指定事务策略，保证在高并发机制冲突下仍有较好的成功率。</span></li><li fid=\"u778a9e39\" data-lake-id=\"ud3a800a6\" id=\"ud3a800a6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uecc627cb\" id=\"uecc627cb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">Spring Boot + Spring Data Redis</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4086b0d\" id=\"uf4086b0d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：简化Redis的操作，使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ucb9c8729\" id=\"ucb9c8729\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubdfc9a8d\" id=\"ubdfc9a8d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">StringRedisTemplate</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud3694434\" id=\"ud3694434\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">redis键值来操作。</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id=\"JpBLj\" id=\"JpBLj\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a8922d4\" id=\"u2a8922d4\"> 代码结构与依赖Maven依赖（示例）  </span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3Cdependencies%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3C!--%20Spring%20Boot%20Starter%20Web%20--%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Cdependency%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CgroupId%3Eorg.springframework.boot%3C%2FgroupId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CartifactId%3Espring-boot-starter-web%3C%2FartifactId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fdependency%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3C!--%20Spring%20Data%20Redis%20--%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Cdependency%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CgroupId%3Eorg.springframework.boot%3C%2FgroupId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CartifactId%3Espring-boot-starter-data-redis%3C%2FartifactId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fdependency%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3C!--%20Spring%20Retry%20--%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Cdependency%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CgroupId%3Eorg.springframework.retry%3C%2FgroupId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CartifactId%3Espring-retry%3C%2FartifactId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fdependency%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3C!--%20Lombok(%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89)%20--%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Cdependency%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CgroupId%3Eorg.projectlombok%3C%2FgroupId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CartifactId%3Elombok%3C%2FartifactId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Coptional%3Etrue%3C%2Foptional%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fdependency%3E%5Cn%3C%2Fdependencies%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G10A9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"qr09i\" id=\"qr09i\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud3d5f01d\" id=\"ud3d5f01d\"> 配置文件（application.yml）</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22spring%3A%5Cn%20%20redis%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20host%3A%20localhost%5Cn%20%20%20%20port%3A%206379%5Cn%20%20%23%20%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E6%B1%A0%EF%BC%8C%E8%B6%85%E6%97%B6%E7%AD%89%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%BC%80%E5%90%AFspring%20retry%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%5Cnspring%3A%5Cn%20%20main%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20allow-bean-definition-overriding%3A%20true%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S4TET%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"zO6zz\" id=\"zO6zz\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6af95b4a\" id=\"u6af95b4a\"> 启用Spring Retry注意事项  </span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"Kaj5e\" id=\"Kaj5e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9d2d710f\" id=\"u9d2d710f\">在应用主类或配置类中启用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue55ef826\" id=\"ue55ef826\"><span data-lake-id=\"uef1e2efb\" id=\"uef1e2efb\">@EnableRetry</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1d0ce351\" id=\"u1d0ce351\">​</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20org.springframework.boot.SpringApplication%3B%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.SpringBootApplication%3B%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.retry.annotation.EnableRetry%3B%5Cn%5Cn%40SpringBootApplication%5Cn%40EnableRetry%5Cnpublic%20class%20SeckillApplication%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20public%20static%20void%20main(String%5B%5D%20args)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20SpringApplication.run(SeckillApplication.class%2C%20args)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dt84o%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"nOE12\" id=\"nOE12\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc7afe3ab\" id=\"uc7afe3ab\">业务实现细节</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"UyB9y\" id=\"UyB9y\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueb263dd3\" id=\"ueb263dd3\">服务逻辑描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"udd86ca00\" id=\"udd86ca00\"><span data-lake-id=\"u457f84e6\" id=\"u457f84e6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">设想一个商品ID为</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc1df6a57\" id=\"uc1df6a57\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3cf399ee\" id=\"u3cf399ee\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">product:1001</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua9d91ac4\" id=\"ua9d91ac4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">，对应的库存键为</span><code data-lake-id=\"u644f7d52\" id=\"u644f7d52\"><span data-lake-id=\"u835d2254\" id=\"u835d2254\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">stock:product:1001</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf638aa23\" id=\"uf638aa23\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">在Redis中维护。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc67dcbb4\" id=\"uc67dcbb4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub8deb457\" id=\"ub8deb457\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">初始值（活动开始前在Redis中设置）</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22SET%20stock%3Aproduct%3A1001%2010%20%20%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%9810%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PmAT9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u39613941\" id=\"u39613941\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9fbddea8\" id=\"u9fbddea8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">在用户下单时，需要执行以下步骤：</span></p><ol list=\"u69e5e3cc\"><li fid=\"u9dedc944\" data-lake-id=\"u0c7ffa5b\" id=\"u0c7ffa5b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue90dcc8e\" id=\"ue90dcc8e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">从Redis中读取当前库存值，如果库存值&gt; 0，则有资格尝试减减。</span></li><li fid=\"u9dedc944\" data-lake-id=\"u2aaf5234\" id=\"u2aaf5234\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5030bfb3\" id=\"u5030bfb3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc39d4c8d\" id=\"uc39d4c8d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u591787c7\" id=\"u591787c7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">WATCH</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4a16070a\" id=\"u4a16070a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">命令控制</span><code data-lake-id=\"ucf95da3a\" id=\"ucf95da3a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubcfd869d\" id=\"ubcfd869d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">stock:product:1001</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucc2dd412\" id=\"ucc2dd412\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">键。</span></li><li fid=\"u9dedc944\" data-lake-id=\"u919abda0\" id=\"u919abda0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ube4c172c\" id=\"ube4c172c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">开启Redis事务（</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufac58066\" id=\"ufac58066\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02a96c79\" id=\"u02a96c79\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">MULTI</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u972a7d5c\" id=\"u972a7d5c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">），尝试</span><code data-lake-id=\"u80d0c097\" id=\"u80d0c097\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3173db1e\" id=\"u3173db1e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">DECR</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udc7b3e51\" id=\"udc7b3e51\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">操作执行将库存减少1。</span></li><li fid=\"u9dedc944\" data-lake-id=\"u048ef36c\" id=\"u048ef36c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b70018e\" id=\"u8b70018e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">执行</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufd44bb00\" id=\"ufd44bb00\"><span data-lake-id=\"u626266cc\" id=\"u626266cc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">EXEC</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0608ed24\" id=\"u0608ed24\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">提交事务，如果</span><code data-lake-id=\"u80fa7249\" id=\"u80fa7249\"><span data-lake-id=\"u595f5def\" id=\"u595f5def\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">EXEC</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u050af101\" id=\"u050af101\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">在前面该键携带其他人修改，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u00d43abe\" id=\"u00d43abe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u656f2306\" id=\"u656f2306\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">EXEC</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub46f163a\" id=\"ub46f163a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">返回成功，否则返回null或失败，说明有并发冲突。</span></li><li fid=\"u9dedc944\" data-lake-id=\"u0fd99376\" id=\"u0fd99376\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua21dda15\" id=\"ua21dda15\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">对并发冲突进行重试（Spring Retry）。在短时间内（如毫秒级）自动多次重试可以最大程度提高成功率。</span></li><li fid=\"u9dedc944\" data-lake-id=\"u3dfd4caf\" id=\"u3dfd4caf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub1704395\" id=\"ub1704395\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">成功扣减后返回下单成功信息，若库存为0则提示库存不足。</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"kAYMn\" id=\"kAYMn\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ecb8c1e\" id=\"u6ecb8c1e\">代码示例</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"j8N6U\" id=\"j8N6U\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf9872567\" id=\"uf9872567\">服务层示例（库存扣减逻辑）</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation.Autowired%3B%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.data.redis.connection.RedisStringCommands%3B%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.data.redis.core.StringRedisTemplate%3B%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.data.redis.core.SessionCallback%3B%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.retry.annotation.Backoff%3B%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.retry.annotation.Retryable%3B%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.stereotype.Service%3B%5Cn%5Cn%40Service%5Cnpublic%20class%20SeckillService%20%7B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%40Autowired%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20StringRedisTemplate%20redisTemplate%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20static%20final%20String%20STOCK_KEY_PREFIX%20%3D%20%5C%22stock%3Aproduct%3A%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F**%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%E5%B0%9D%E8